      <mxCell id="s_body" value="similarity = max cosine(skill, resume chunk) over 200-word chunks, 50 overlap&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;if the resume names the skill or an alias verbatim: similarity = max(similarity, 0.75)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;severity: &amp;gt;= 0.75 covered · 0.62 to 0.75 partial · below 0.62 missing&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;credit = 0 at or below 0.62, linear to 1 at 0.75&lt;br&gt;score = round(100 · Σ weight·credit / Σ weight)&lt;br&gt;weight = 1 + 0.5·min(JD mentions − 1, 2)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacing=8;fillColor=#FFF1DC;strokeColor=#A35E00;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
